OL,3,GNEWSAWoman arrested in connection with
OL,4,Aillegal money lending in Campbeltown
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 55-year-old woman has been arrested
OL,7,Fin connection with illegal money
OL,8,Flending in Campbeltown.
OL,10,FIt followed a joint operation by police
OL,11,Fofficers in the Argyll and Bute town
OL,12,Fand Trading Standards' Scottish Illegal
OL,13,FMoney Lending Unit (SIMLU).
OL,15,FPolice assisted with the execution of
OL,16,Fan arrest warrant and carried out a
OL,17,Fsearch at an address on Wednesday,
OL,18,Ffollowing intelligence from the public.
OL,20,FThe woman was released pending further
OL,21,Finquiries and a report will be sent to
OL,22,Fthe procurator fiscal.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
